  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.出法兰城西门，前往芙蕾雅岛（201.165）处与士兵卡夏平对话，进入莎莲娜海底洞窟。",
      "type": "cave-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆莎莲娜海底洞窟进洞条件：见文末小贴士",
      "type": "gate-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆怀旧服可利用【蒂娜村传送券】（仅白天可使用）、【阿巴尼斯村传送券】，皆为单人传送，具体见《低等级就职咒术师攻略》文章。",
      "type": "server-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆道具服可花100点在道具商城购买【万能传送卷】",
      "type": "server-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆莎莲娜海底洞窟内的魔物：",
      "type": "encounter-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "Lv.25~27绿色口臭鬼，血量约600，植物系，属性：地90风10；技能：攻击、防御、毒性攻击",
      "type": "encounter-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Lv.25~27果冻史莱姆，血量约600，特殊系，属性：火90水10；技能：攻击、防御、吸血攻击",
      "type": "encounter-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "2. 通过（20.8）处楼梯抵达莎莲娜海底洞窟地下2楼，前往（31.21）调查（31.22）处，输入“咒术”，全队变更场景。",
      "type": "password-route",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "3.往南行走至（38.37）进入咒术师的秘密住处，与咒术师希索普（13.7）对话，选“是”获得【咒器·红念珠】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆若只想学习各种强力状态魔法或各种状态抵抗，只需此时继续往北前行，进入后方走道，",
      "type": "optional-training-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "再往东或西进入房间分别学习强力状态魔法或状态抵抗即可，不必获取【咒器·红念珠】，也不必完成后续步骤，费用皆为5000G。",
      "type": "optional-training-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "⑴往东进入房间分别学习强力状态魔法：",
      "type": "training-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "毒学研究家希索（10.13），催眠师海婆婆（11.6），石头收藏者甘佐（12.8），醉鬼笨鹰（9.10），混乱术师达蒙（13.11），健忘的阿萨（15.9）。",
      "type": "teacher-list",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "⑵往西进入房间分别学习状态抵抗：",
      "type": "training-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "抗毒之书（11.7），抗昏睡之书（11.9），抗石化之书（11.13），抗醉之书（11.15），抗混乱之书（14.7），抗忘却之书（16.9）。",
      "type": "book-list",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
